// Article 4. Architectural changes: approval, and approval by silence.
#require "1-association.charter".
Fact committee Identified by ArchitecturalCommittee
Fact change
Fact applied Identified by owner * change
Fact approved Identified by owner * change
Fact refused Identified by owner * change

Act apply Actor owner Recipient committee Related to change
  Holds when True
  Creates change, applied()
Act approve Actor committee Recipient owner Related to change
  Holds when applied()
  Creates approved()
Power refuse Actor committee Recipient owner Related to change
  Holds when applied()
  Valid when Not(Held(applied()) For 30)
  Creates refused()
Fact permitted Identified by owner * change
  Holds when approved() || (Held(applied()) For 30 && Not(refused()))
Act make-change Actor owner Related to change
  Holds when permitted()

Clause 4.1 Approved "c2fdea41b0abaf9fb0d0d8b4b3432c51f33b41f7a23dcd4f76becb531d8375a1"
  Norm "An owner may not change the outside of a house without the approval of the architectural committee." => make-change, approve
Clause 4.2 Approved "50bfa6fed25c726fd8a050c332173d78122eec4f71a27b39712bc8842af2e230"
  Norm "The owner applies to the committee in writing." => apply
  Norm " If the committee has neither approved nor refused an application thirty days after it was made, the application is deemed approved." => make-change, refuse
Clause 4.3 Approved "e8a0cc28d47753d6ce87871ee2536dbdb79278c6f33cc158dc714ddde4fb73a8"
  Norm "A refusal made after those thirty days has no effect." => refuse
.
